WEBVTT

00:07:59.120 --> 00:08:02.130
with women I was encouraged
to call surrogates,

00:08:02.685 --> 00:08:05.226
who were not exactly prostitutes

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.151
but who were also
not exactly anything else.

00:08:08.175 --> 00:08:11.470
(Laughter)

00:08:12.443 --> 00:08:16.656
My particular favorite
was a blonde woman from the Deep South

00:08:16.680 --> 00:08:20.707
who eventually admitted to me
that she was really a necrophiliac,

00:08:20.731 --> 00:08:23.510
and had taken this job
after she got in trouble

00:08:23.534 --> 00:08:24.983
down at the morgue.

00:08:25.007 --> 00:08:28.854
(Laughter)